WIRE.md §10, SPEC §3.1 (DECISIONS 332): the root lines with project.local.canon
applied: web is placed by it on an existing directory, src is an optional root absent on this
machine and ends its line with " absent", out lies inside the project; project.local.canon has no
file line, its effect being the root lines.
-- project.canon --
project acme {
  canon: "0.1"

  roots {
    out: "out"
    src: "../Source"
    web: "../web"
  }
  optional_roots: [src]
}
-- project.local.canon --
project acme {
  roots {
    web: "../work/web"
  }
}
-- ../work/web/.keep --
